desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Template And Attributes"
	title_zh: "检测到Template And Attributes",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-template-and-attributes"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `template-and-attributes` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/javascript/express/security/audit/xss/pug/and-attributes.yaml).
Original message: Detected a unescaped variables using '&attributes'. If external data can reach these locations, your application is exposed to a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability. If you must do this, ensure no external data can reach this location.

CWE: CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')
References:
- https://pugjs.org/language/attributes.html#attributes
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review the flagged code and follow the framework's secure coding guidance: use safe APIs, escape output, and avoid hardcoded credentials.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.pug": <<<POS
(]IZ0Ui)W9c&attributes290

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.pug}.pattern_regex(/.*&attributes.*/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Template And Attributes",
	title_zh: "检测到Template And Attributes",
	message: "Template And Attributes",
}
